{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0101-symmetric-tree","title":"LeetCode 101 对称二叉树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0101-symmetric-tree","wordCount":922,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-101-对称二叉树\">LeetCode 101 对称二叉树</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个二叉树的根节点 <code>root</code>，检查它是否轴对称。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中节点数目在范围 <code>[1, 1000]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 4, 3]&#10;        1&#10;       / \\&#10;      2   2&#10;     / \\ / \\&#10;    3  4 4  3&#10;输出：true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 4, 3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      2   2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     / \\ / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    3  4 4  3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [1, 2, 2, null, 3, null, 3]&#10;        1&#10;       / \\&#10;      2   2&#10;       \\   \\&#10;       3    3&#10;输出：false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [1, 2, 2, null, 3, null, 3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      2   2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       \\   \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       3    3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：false</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>进阶：</strong> 你可以运用递归和迭代两种方法解决这个问题吗？</p>\n<p>对称二叉树是「相同的树」（LC #100）的变体。如果说 LC #100 是判断两棵树是否完全一致，那么本题是判断一棵树的左右子树是否「镜像对称」。理解两者的联系与差异，能帮助你掌握递归比较的灵活运用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"对称的定义\">对称的定义</h3><p>一棵树是对称的，等价于它的左子树和右子树互为镜像。而两棵树互为镜像，当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>两棵树的根节点值相同</li>\n<li>第一棵树的左子树与第二棵树的右子树镜像对称</li>\n<li>第一棵树的右子树与第二棵树的左子树镜像对称</li>\n</ol>\n<p>与 LC #100 的关键区别在于递归方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较类型</th>\n<th>左子树对应</th>\n<th>右子树对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相同的树</td>\n<td>left ↔ left</td>\n<td>right ↔ right</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称的树</td>\n<td>left ↔ right</td>\n<td>right ↔ left</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"递归法\">递归法</h3><p>将问题转化为辅助函数 <code>isMirror(left, right)</code>：判断两棵子树是否互为镜像。初始调用为 <code>isMirror(root.left, root.right)</code>。</p>\n<p>终止条件与 LC #100 一致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两者都为空 → true</li>\n<li>一个为空一个不为空 → false</li>\n<li>两者值不相等 → false</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"迭代法-队列\">迭代法（队列）</h3><p>使用队列存储需要比较的节点对。每次从队列取出两个节点进行比较，然后将它们的子节点按镜像顺序入队：<code>(left.left, right.right)</code> 和 <code>(left.right, right.left)</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"递归法-推荐\">递归法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function isSymmetric(root: TreeNode | null): boolean {&#10;  if (root === null) {&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return isMirror(root.left, root.right);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function isMirror(left: TreeNode | null, right: TreeNode | null): boolean {&#10;  if (left === null &amp;&amp; right === null) {&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (left === null || right === null) {&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return left.val === right.val &amp;&amp; isMirror(left.left, right.right) &amp;&amp; isMirror(left.right, right.left);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSymmetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isMirror</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.left, root.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isMirror</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isMirror</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(left.left, right.right) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isMirror</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(left.right, right.left);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"迭代法-队列\">迭代法（队列）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isSymmetric(root: TreeNode | null): boolean {&#10;  if (root === null) {&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const queue: Array&lt;[TreeNode | null, TreeNode | null]&gt; = [[root.left, root.right]];&#10;&#10;  while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const [left, right] = queue.shift()!;&#10;&#10;    if (left === null &amp;&amp; right === null) {&#10;      continue;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (left === null || right === null) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (left.val !== right.val) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    queue.push([left.left, right.right]);&#10;    queue.push([left.right, right.left]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return true;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSymmetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[root.left, root.right]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([left.left, right.right]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([left.right, right.left]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>递归执行过程：</strong></p>\n<p>以对称树 <code>[1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 4, 3]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>比较</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>isMirror(2, 2)</td>\n<td>val=2</td>\n<td>val=2</td>\n<td>值相等</td>\n<td>继续递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isMirror(3, 3)</td>\n<td>val=3</td>\n<td>val=3</td>\n<td>值相等，子节点都为空</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isMirror(4, 4)</td>\n<td>val=4</td>\n<td>val=4</td>\n<td>值相等，子节点都为空</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>所有镜像对均匹配，返回 <code>true</code>。</p>\n<p>以非对称树 <code>[1, 2, 2, null, 3, null, 3]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>比较</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>isMirror(2, 2)</td>\n<td>val=2</td>\n<td>val=2</td>\n<td>值相等</td>\n<td>继续递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isMirror(null, null)</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>都为空</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isMirror(3, 3)</td>\n<td>val=3</td>\n<td>val=3</td>\n<td>值相等</td>\n<td>继续递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isMirror(null, null)</td>\n<td>left.left</td>\n<td>right.right</td>\n<td>都为空</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isMirror(null, null)</td>\n<td>left.right</td>\n<td>right.left</td>\n<td>都为空</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>等一下，这棵树实际上 left 的右子节点是 3，right 的右子节点也是 3。让我们重新分析：左子树的结构是 <code>2 → right: 3</code>，右子树的结构是 <code>2 → right: 3</code>。调用 <code>isMirror(left.left=null, right.right=3)</code>，一个为空一个不为空，返回 <code>false</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>h 为树的高度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代（队列）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最坏情况队列存储一层节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 每个节点最多被访问一次，因此时间复杂度为 O(n)，其中 n 为节点总数。实际上，如果树不对称，递归会提前终止，实际访问的节点数可能远小于 n。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 递归法的空间取决于递归深度，即树的高度 h。最坏情况（退化为链表）为 O(n)，平衡树为 O(log n)。迭代法使用队列，最坏情况下一层的节点数为 O(n/2)，空间为 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>与 LC #100 的对比：</strong> 本题本质上是将「判断两棵树是否相同」转化为「判断两棵子树是否镜像」，只需要将递归调用中的方向交叉即可。这种「微调递归方向」的技巧在树类问题中非常常见，例如翻转二叉树、合并二叉树等都可以通过类似的模式变换来实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 101 对称二叉树","id":"leetcode-101-对称二叉树"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"对称的定义","id":"对称的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"递归法","id":"递归法"},{"level":3,"text":"迭代法（队列）","id":"迭代法-队列"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"递归法（推荐）","id":"递归法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"迭代法（队列）","id":"迭代法-队列"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 100 相同的树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0100-same-tree"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 104 二叉树的最大深度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0104-maximum-depth"}}